{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51176","headline":"五言（八首） 三 · 王梵志","name":"五言（八首） 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不愿大大富，不愿大大贫。\n昨日了今日，今日了明晨。\n此之大大因，[彼之大大身]。\n（此句据《说郛》卷一引《云溪友议》补。\n）所愿只如此，真成上上人。\n（今按：疑缺第五句。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51176.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51176","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}